{
  "id": "cloud-build-run",
  "title": "一次 Cloud Build 建置",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "src",
      "label": "原始碼",
      "detail": "上傳成 .tgz",
      "col": 0,
      "row": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cb",
      "label": "Cloud Build",
      "detail": "依序執行步驟",
      "col": 1,
      "row": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ar",
      "label": "儲存庫",
      "detail": "Artifact Registry",
      "col": 2,
      "row": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "run",
      "label": "Cloud Run",
      "detail": "服務",
      "col": 1,
      "row": 0
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "from": "src",
      "to": "cb",
      "text": "gcloud builds submit 把目錄打包上傳，Cloud Build 讀取 cloudbuild.yaml。"
    },
    {
      "from": "cb",
      "text": "步驟 #0：用 docker 映像檔執行 docker build。$PROJECT_ID、$BUILD_ID 先換成實際的值。"
    },
    {
      "from": "cb",
      "to": "ar",
      "text": "步驟 #1：docker push。儲存庫不存在，這個步驟失敗，後面的步驟不會執行。",
      "status": "fail"
    },
    {
      "from": "cb",
      "text": "建立 Artifact Registry 儲存庫後重新提交，這次推送成功。"
    },
    {
      "from": "cb",
      "to": "ar",
      "text": "步驟 #1：映像檔推送到 Artifact Registry。"
    },
    {
      "from": "cb",
      "to": "run",
      "text": "步驟 #2：用 Cloud SDK 映像檔執行 gcloud run deploy，部署新版本。"
    }
  ]
}
